5000/tcp open  http       Werkzeug httpd 3.1.9 (Python 3.12.16)
5432/tcp open  postgresql PostgreSQL DB
7000/tcp open  rtsp
2 services unrecognized despite returning data. If you know the service/version, please submit the following fingerprints at https://nmap.org/cgi-bin/su ...

[step 1] reasoning:
Good! I can see:
- **Port 5000**: Werkzeug HTTP server (Python web app) — this is my target
- **Port 5432**: PostgreSQL (backend database)
- **Port 7000**: AirTunes service (not relevant)

Let me probe the web application starting with the root endpoint to understand the structure.

